    "result_text": "The full suite is green \u2014 **23 tests, 0 failures, 0 errors, BUILD SUCCESS**.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `membershipNumber` field formatted as `<customerCode>-M<YY>` (e.g. `SMI-0007-M26`), following the existing pattern used for the other derived owner fields (`displayName`, `initials`).\n\nTwo changes:\n\n1. **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added a derived getter `getMembershipNumber()` that returns `customerCode` + `-M` + the last two digits of `registrationDate`'s year (zero-padded via `year % 100`). It returns `null` if either source field is unset, mirroring the guarded style of the other derived getters.\n\n2. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `membershipNumber` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` includes it and MapStruct auto-maps it from `Owner.getMembershipNumber()`.\n\nBecause the value is derived from the owner's own `customerCode` and `registrationDate`, it's seed-independent, matching what `Cp14Tests` asserts.",
